          `Ab "what-if" sawaal poochhte hain.

**What if VPN ki jagah sirf proxy use karein?** Kaam chal jaayega — website ko tumhara IP nahi dikhega. Par tumhara data encrypt nahi hoga, aur sirf browser ka traffic proxy se jayega, baaki apps ka nahi. Public WiFi par baithe ho toh beech mein koi tumhara data padh sakta hai. VPN poore device ko cover karta hai, proxy sirf ek app ko.

**What if proxy hata kar direct connect karein?** Website seedha tumhare IP se baat karegi aur tumhara location pata chal jayega. College ka cache bhi nahi milega — har student ko har page internet se dobara download karna padega, aur bandwidth khatm ho jaayega. Proxy ka cache aur IP hiding dono kaam ke hain.

**What if firewall hata dein?** Office ka network internet par khula pad jaayega — bahar se koi bhi kisi bhi port par connect kar sakta hai. Ek din mein bots aur attackers andar aa jaayenge. Firewall ke bina network aise hai jaise ghar ka darwaza khula chhod diya ho. Neeche wala pehla extra example VPN overhead ginata hai aur doosra proxy cache ke hits aur misses ginata hai — 6 requests mein 3 hits, 50% hit rate.`,
          `Now let us ask "what-if" questions.

**What if we use only a proxy instead of a VPN?** It will work — the website will not see your IP. But your data will not be encrypted, and only the browser traffic will go through the proxy, not the other apps. Sitting on public WiFi, someone in the middle can read your data. A VPN covers the whole device; a proxy covers only one app.

**What if we remove the proxy and connect directly?** The website will talk straight to your IP and learn your location. The college cache will be gone too — every student will have to download every page from the internet again, and the bandwidth will run out. Both the proxy cache and its IP hiding are useful.

**What if we remove the firewall?** The office network will lie open on the internet — anyone from outside can connect on any port. Within a day, bots and attackers will be inside. A network without a firewall is like a house with the front door left open. The first extra example below counts the VPN overhead, and the second counts proxy cache hits and misses — 3 hits out of 6 requests, a 50% hit rate.`
